    "description": "<p>You begin to generate acidic medical chakra and mold it into an arrow, lance or bolt.</p>\n<p>Make a ranged ninjutsu attack against a creature in range. On a hit you deal 4d6 acid damage. All creatures in a 15-foot cone originating from the target much make a Dexterity saving throw, being Corroded on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
